# Outlaw Server is a Linux OS — every script here runs on Linux, during the CI
# ISO build AND on the installed system. A Windows checkout/edit must never
# smuggle CRLF into a script (a `#!/bin/bash\r` shebang or `set -eo pipefail\r`
# silently breaks it). Force LF for all text files, in the repo and the working
# tree. Binary files are auto-detected and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
